        <mxCell id="c221" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined in coral: the total of A1 to A4 on retained earnings, on each year&#x27;s income and on the year-end balances. Outlined in teal: the adjusted net income, recorded income plus that total, with G10 selected. Each text cell is drawn with its first line only (the workbook&#x27;s rows are tall enough for the whole text); rows 11 and 14 are blank and row 19, the clearly trivial freight estimate, is below the block drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="898" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
